# Huntington Select Project Rules

We are building Huntington Select with:
- Next.js App Router
- TypeScript
- Tailwind CSS
- Supabase
- Stripe
- Resend
- Vercel

User has no coding experience.

Important rules:
- Make small, focused changes only.
- Do not rewrite unrelated files.
- Before editing, explain which files will change.
- Prefer simple architecture over complex abstractions.
- Keep code beginner-friendly.
- Do not add paid services unless requested.
- Do not expose secret keys in client code.
- Use Server Components by default.
- Use Client Components only when interactivity is required.
- Keep UI clean, modern, mobile-friendly, and easy to navigate.